/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/15/1gagv.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダウンタウンさんたちのトークもめっちゃ面白かった(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日レッスンのときにメンバーに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バレンタインのチョコもらったー〓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うれしいよー(≧ω≦)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみは作る時間あんまりなくて作れなかったからもうちょっとだけ待っててねー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それじゃぁばいにゃーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/15/kuroneko.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-14494":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずは、代々木第一体育館でのライブ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとうに、ほんとうにありがとうございました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/10/07/5749019/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハーフアップ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しすぎて、始まりから終わりまで本当あっという間。(´･ω･`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっともっと、ステージで踊っていたかったな。(´･ω･`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからこそ、武道館が決まったときには嬉しくて涙がでてきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気づかないうちだったな。嬉しすぎたのかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで、代々木、最高でした！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方の目の前までいけたから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しんでもらいたいという思いは伝わったと信じてますわ♡！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/10/07/5749019/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いくちゃん、ちーちゃん、ひめたん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だいすき中3組！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブ終了直後だから汗びっしょり。(´・д・｀)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとにみなさんありがとうございました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(●´-` ●)(●´-` ●)(●´-` ●)(●´-` ●)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、７thシングル、選抜発表。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後、みさみさ、ひめたん、本当に本当におめでとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっと、ずっと待ってやっと、花が咲いたね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと辛かったよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと頑張ってきたよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その頑張りを知ってるからこそ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"涙が止まらなかったよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方がなんで今までこの子達が入らなかったんだ、って絶対思うはず。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂ファンの方はそれをわかってるから大丈夫だよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ってきてね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、わたし。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだろう。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回はいつもよりも悔しいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しょうがない、まだまだだもん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからだよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか言い訳してきたけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうそんな言い訳なんて通用しなくなってきた。よね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国のzeppでライブしたり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は代々木でライブが無事終了したり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後輩が増えたり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しづつ名前を覚えてもらったり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この夏、全力で駆け抜けてきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして去年に比べたら自分に自信が持てるようになりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、どうしても結果がついてこない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"花が、咲かない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"蕾のままだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうしたらいいんだろう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうしたら花が咲くのだろう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうしたら蕾が割れるのだろう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここまできたら、悩んでる暇なんてない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"考えてる暇なんて少しもない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の目の前で輝いてる子たちからたくさんのものを吸収して、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一歩一歩成長していくしかない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しづつ少しづつ、蕾を膨らませていくしかない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつ咲くかわからないけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その日を信じて地道に頑張るしかない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと前に、わたしは縁の下の力持ちです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんて言ってた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"縁の下なんていやだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"縁の下の力持ちだって必要かもしれない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、前にでなければ、表に出なければ、なにも始まらない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたし、変わりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分を持つこと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブレないこと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"競争心を持つこと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして時に支え合うこと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても大切だと思う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか咲く花のために、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"蕾を、膨らませていきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-10889":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん!!\nおこんにちは!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぱふぉぱふぉ〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぱふぉぱふぉ〜ぱふぉ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/03/13/6492282/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぱふぉぱふぉ〜ぱふぉ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/03/13/6492282/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日友達からぱふぉって単語がメールで送られてきて、面白いから使ってみた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぱっふぉぱふぉにしてやんよっ!!\n(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ところで!!\nみなさん!!\n今日はなんの日!?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうっ!!\n本日3月13日は『君の名は希望』の発売日ですよ〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぱふぉ〜!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここで告知"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/03/13/6492282/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の0:00〜\n「君の名は希望」に収録される楽曲の着うたが全曲配信になりましたっ!!\nぜひレコチョクをチェック☆⌒（＊＾∇゜）v\nレコチョクでは、待ち受け画像がもらえたりサイン入り色紙やポスターが抽選で当たりますので詳しくは公式HPでチェック☆⌒（＊＾∇゜）v"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もひとつ!!\nシャキイズムの着うた配信についてですヽ(・∀・)ノ私、いこまは『シャキキャラ』というキャラクターを書かせて頂きました！\nそのキャラクターの待受けがもらえたり、イラスト色紙が抽選で当たるので、詳しくは公式HPをチェック"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/03/13/6492282/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず!!\n君の名は希望は凄くいい曲ですヽ(・∀・)ノ\nいこま的には、今何か悩